<aside class="site-assistant" aria-labelledby="site-assistant-title">
  <div class="site-assistant__body">
    <p class="site-assistant__eyebrow">Website Assistant</p>
    <h2 id="site-assistant-title">Find the right SAG path.</h2>
    <p>Use these verified website routes to review services, government and teaming information, or start a defined requirement. The assistant does not make pricing, availability, qualification, credential, accreditation, or regulatory claims.</p>
    <nav aria-label="Website assistant shortcuts" class="site-assistant__actions">
      <a href="/services">Explore services</a>
      <a href="/government">Government & teaming</a>
      <a href="/request-proposal">Request a proposal</a>
      <a href="https://institute.safetyassuranceglobal.com">Institute information</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="site-assistant__fallback">Need something not verified here? <a href="/contact">Contact the appropriate SAG team.</a></p>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
.site-assistant{margin:2rem 0;padding:0 1rem}.site-assistant__body{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:1rem;background:var(--color-surface)}.site-assistant__eyebrow{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.site-assistant h2{margin:.25rem 0 .5rem}.site-assistant__body>p{max-width:78ch}.site-assistant__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;margin:1rem 0}.site-assistant__actions a{display:inline-flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center;padding:.65rem .85rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:.65rem;font-weight:700}.site-assistant__fallback{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
</style>
